---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SocialBar from '../components/SocialBar.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
	<main>
		<div class="flex flex-row gap-8 border border-neutral-800 rounded-4xl p-8 sm:p-12 mb-12 bg-black hover:border-neutral-50 text-center" >
			<div class="w-32 h-32 sm:w-48 sm:h-48 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
					<img
					src="src\assets\Sample_User_Icon.png"
					alt="Photo of Aric Olsen"
					class="bg-white rounded-full"
				/>
			</div>
			<div class="flex-grow flex flex-col gap-3">
                <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-white tracking-wider">
                    Aric Olsen
                </h1>
				<span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-neutral-400 ">
					Academic | Tutor | Researcher | Runner | Leader | Brother | Son | Partner
				</span>
				<span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-neutral-400 mt-2">
					<SocialBar/>
				</span>
            </div>

		</div>
			
		<p>
				Hey There! I am Aric. This site is the hub for all of my pursuits. Whether you are brought here by my academic, professional, hobbyist,
				or personal roles, you have found the right place to access all things me!
		</p>
		<p>
				In case you haven't met me, or are looking for an update on what i've been up to, here are some of the roles I play 
				in our world:
		</p>
		<p>
			<code>Student: Aerospace Engineering (B.Eng)</code><br>
			<code>Tutor: Math, Physics, Chemistry</code><br>	
			<code>Leader: Propulsion Project Manager (MetRocketry)</code><br>
		</p>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>
